# Things the deployed app never reads.
#
# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory, not the git tree — so untracking the generated
# social media from git did nothing for deploys, and the upload had grown to 326 MB and started
# failing outright ("fetch failed" partway through). None of this is imported by app code; the
# published copies live on Vercel Blob and everything here is reproducible from the scripts.

content/
docs/
scripts/data/
scripts/mirror-backup-*.json
exports/
.claude/
.agents/
.superpowers/
